    面 | miàn | flour; noodles; face; surface

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 馒头 refers specifically to plain, solid steamed wheat buns without any internal filling.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 馒头 vs. 包子 | bāozi | 馒头 is solid steamed dough with no internal filling, whereas 包子 has an inner savory (meat, veg) or sweet (bean paste) filling wrapped inside dough.
    2 | 馒头 vs. 面包 | miànbāo | 馒头 is cooked via moist high-temperature steaming (蒸), whereas 面包 is baked in dry ovens (烤), having an outer crust.
    3 | 馒头 vs. 花卷 | huājuǎn | 馒头 is shaped into smooth rounded or oval buns, while 花卷 is layered, twisted, and brushed with oil, scallions, or spices.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 冬日清晨的北方农家，灶膛里柴火正旺，大铁锅上架着高高的竹蒸笼。当白生生、热腾腾的大馒头端上桌，掰开一块抹上芝麻酱，那一口朴实醇厚的面香直透心底。 | Dōngrì qīngchén de běifāng nóngjiā, zàotáng lǐ cháihuo zhèng wàng, dà tiěguō shàng jià zhe gāogāo de zhúzhēnglóng. Dāng báishēngshēng, rèténgténg de dà mántou duān shàngzhuō, bāikāi yí kuài mǒ shàng zhīmajiàng, nà yì kǒu pǔshí chúnhòu de miànxiāng zhí tòu xīndǐ. | On winter mornings in northern homes, firewood roars under iron cauldrons and bamboo steamers. Tearing into a hot, white mantou spread with sesame paste fills the heart with pure aroma. | En el alba invernal de la aldea norteña, la leña crepita bajo la vaporera. Al abrir un tierno panecillo humeante y untarlo con sésamo, su sabor franco reconforta las entrañas.
  #2 | 从三国时期诸葛亮以面代首的传奇演化，到如今成为北方千家万户不可或缺的餐桌主角，看似普通的馒头见证了华夏面食文化的千年演进，蕴含着厚重质朴的生活智慧。 | Cóng Sānguó shíqī Zhūgě Liàng yǐ miàn dài shǒu de chuánqí yǎnhuà, dào rújīn chéngwéi běifāng qiānjiā-wànhù bùkě-huòquē de cānzhuō zhǔjiào, kànsì pǔtōng de mántou jiànzhèng le Huáxià miànshí wénhuà de qiānnián yǎnjìn, yùnhán zhe hòuzhòng zhìpǔ de shēnghuó zhìhuì. | From Zhuge Liang's legend to northern family tables today, the humble mantou bears witness to millennia of Chinese wheat culinary culture, brimming with simple wisdom of daily life. | Desde la leyenda de Zhuge Liang hasta los hogares del norte, el modesto panecillo al vapor encarna milenios de tradición culinaria harinera, albergando la sobria sabiduría del sustento popular.
